{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-endpoints","title":"恒星终态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"white-dwarfs","title":"白矮星与电子简并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/white-dwarfs","wordCount":2284,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"neutron-stars-pulsars","title":"中子星与脉冲星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/neutron-stars-pulsars","wordCount":2525,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"black-hole-formation","title":"恒星级黑洞形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/black-hole-formation","wordCount":2694,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"恒星终态\">恒星终态</h1><p>本章探讨恒星演化的最终产物：白矮星、中子星和恒星级黑洞。这些致密天体具有极端的物理性质——超高密度、强引力场、强磁场——将物质推向已知物理学的极限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心主题\">核心主题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>白矮星</strong> — 电子简并压支撑、钱德拉塞卡极限、冷却序列</li>\n<li><strong>中子星与脉冲星</strong> — 中子简并与强相互作用、脉冲辐射机制、磁星</li>\n<li><strong>恒星级黑洞</strong> — 形成路径、质量间隙问题、引力波探测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"致密天体基本性质对比\">致密天体基本性质对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>白矮星</th>\n<th>中子星</th>\n<th>恒星级黑洞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>典型质量</td>\n<td>0.5–1.4 M☉</td>\n<td>1.2–2.5 M☉</td>\n<td>3–100 M☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型半径</td>\n<td>~10⁴ km</td>\n<td>~10 km</td>\n<td>R_s = 2GM/c²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型密度</td>\n<td>~10⁹ kg/m³</td>\n<td>~10¹⁷ kg/m³</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支撑机制</td>\n<td>电子简并压</td>\n<td>中子简并压+强力</td>\n<td>无（视界内无静态结构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量上限</td>\n<td>1.44 M☉</td>\n<td>~2.2–2.5 M☉</td>\n<td>无理论上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}